  "dct_description_sm": [
    "# Philippines Typhoon Odette: Damage and Flood Proxy Maps, Dec 2021 The **Earth Observatory of Singapore – Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS)** produced these damage and flood proxy maps for Philippines Typhoon Odette (Dec 2021) from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images. Each map is a separate ZIP below with its GeoTIFF, a KMZ for Google Earth, the PNG figures and a text file describing how it was made and how to read it. ## Maps in this dataset - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9 wbd** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.5 wbd** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.5** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9 wbd** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9 wbd** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.9** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.5 wbd** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.5** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.4 wbd** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.4** (superseded) - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.3** - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.35** - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Philippines, Typhoon Odette, Dec 2021, v0.3** (superseded) **More map details and files:** **More map details and files:**"
